{"id": null, "n": "0070002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070002", "type": "orig", "text": "「右……一」五字，底本不清，據甲本補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0070003", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0070003", "type": "orig", "text": "「何……此」，四字，底本不清，據甲本補。"}
