{"id": null, "n": "0076001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076001", "type": "orig", "text": "「闇……見」五字，底本不清，據甲本補。"}
{"id": null, "n": "0076002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0076002", "type": "orig", "text": "「存……則」九字，底本不清，據甲本補。"}
